ary","summary":"**Ensuring evidence context is clear**\n\nI need to make sure that the reader understands the context of any unfamiliar evidence I present. It’s crucial to help them connect the dots, so they don’t feel lost or confused. I want to provide enough background information without overwhelming them. It’s all about creating a balance that makes the evidence feel relevant and integrated into the bigger picture. I think this is essential for effective communication!","format":"openai-responses-v1","index":2},{"type":"reasoning.encrypted","data":"gAAAAABq8PtPi7BL7LoMBCuaRUR4kSRlT-zd1vB5IeY6LaHA9DiVr6fy4_E3CQ_HfhifCcQWvqZMGz4fWlpLb-E_RkVACUmjRP8NZ7qri50FxsLvuC21FNrwfBcfZlpwcS55Zaa4Tot7bcYzgTvD-Oq_p_6e81od6JpxHFZ1N2GNxNHSiZjMdLkAXuCwUwJAT7Sc03rXhZ35guKpaCenEiS_jDI_1nf6Z4Mj6Tiu7KSc_P5nqBmhPg8Ow14belDZSKBKEgk3VmMoxgVd0O8X0kESKoraD0Om4xqrnjWwWgTKGEJ7i_E7-h6XAu-ozcbbqoUhCTitTbars9F4gJcB86fXnr19nj20gi64bZDirXuUDHEQZacQHIffsxWF3iwmibkzO4--LlQpFCp_5SawkKOowjdkGAW8YZfsRQcf0mzE4h3dUmbT3qo50xf3Z5ReafqrzMucscV8dICIdQxRmYtdJp7VNE6_GHrsHFnGNwJbK2JzRO2HO1k6QpdVjW_AD2VvrFultMXoOdJUe5AOzABM1YCrJqcqxzzPjxrtBht8zsSL4E2FlMv9yhb11I-X47PXLoKJ5Qk-3_1fY2aEHgJf5fCDvLLiXLGAVW5oYEDC_Q0Lw582_XGnkckv4Ty5J05hUCqsjPTXaUb-zDbYk6WWeGWD6Y2hsaZBe9xos7Iz3XelI8i3lVgZIHqlC1FKlvk1lIluInOZ76DPJxCYc3rSkU-INifSSZsvUlAxw1_2X70Sf6UblBxgXovYZ2NwQ1G8-TS6byQusw5ctXqvLp58yoa4RRPPOszt3Xf2VEQvYURo1FkEHrkFRAMFH-b7heRY-MxOEPMg4R-tQPgOslos2rGZXRA0qtDx5ez2dERABTh8qnmZAbuyLFjlQjErWMd0e47dKcLIov7j-K2ZNOkD1BGQ7eR1fjfmf-x6VGI--_Eeo1jAl136IYoSKSmHaxXLulrppgtKaySHng-4MBChRIR-Ds-MwTqhd0Tf9435rEVxGc6fL1cbxwcjRlUsLReRgyRxQTjPulgcqKDX6PI-9ZycNKitZdGK8iWVe2fOpcIyNyvF-OASPKMbzaegkYbfhwpA2PcXrQvytERIvqdwaa6LzHDUj1kk50ZC9J69tcbY1Tnw-AsfF2XLbAaC4ZpcFSlzAvJ3VlyldQQqusNo1dlQA7-Dt10uLunXAjT31s4rVWrB1m_cMYkGTHkcDYEtKQXuD54xjBvCaUXSvNHdnNppE57gbc0Ahif0PJ9XPzH1zRzt7E7LeN1hjkFDLaThqe5Lsr4rCb22QPPzOE0MpuvP4VT_P9w9hD6TK1-3JtullV4yMmTFseCPIXdnA2E9qrdKRKmz__WwXt8a3n2OvsYHX1fZCYHs_CtJ3QYF9Uk71MmpavaKd0POTan4Sj2qP41WQMYxINNrS575NvMX13ObdOXD